      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's an interesting way to rank them. I'm a little confused by the ordering though—usually, for a Senior Lead role, you'd want someone with that kind of big-tech experience and leadership background like Alexander. \n\nWhy did you put him third? Also, you mentioned being unconvinced about Malik's charisma. What exactly in his resume or background gave you that impression? He has a lot of technical depth there.",
